# Second shared fixture grammar: plus-separated words of lowercase letters
# (cat+dog+bird). Concurrency suites load it beside the keyvalue grammar so
# two different parsers, with different hook lists, run side by side.

Document
| WordList
|

WordList
| Word WordListTail

WordListTail
| "+" WordList
|

Word@tally
| letter WordTail

WordTail
| letter WordTail
|
